{"2145880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Horde", "steam_appid": 2145880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/c0c6c1bf0bd9c3a3e3ea140f8de10a06.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Civilization has fallen.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Horde, launch yourself to the Zone and die purging the Hellspawn invasion in the humanity's last stand while competing for the highest scored <strong>Hellruns</strong> on the official leaderboards with other players!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/be334a415d396a8657eb290eea3705f0.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes signature <i>Ultraviolent gameplay</i> combined with 2.5D physics will put a smile even on the most conservative face. Shoot, slice, burn, electrocute, blow-up and pulverize hundreds of enemies at the same time. Combining kills also adds score multiplier (and makes you look like a pro). </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/bf6f2db9da6a050612d5e7251ca03917.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <i>Hellrun</i> is divided to different Zones, that need to be purged from the Hellspawn to advance into the next one. Typical <i>Hellrun</i> only takes a few minutes. Perfect time killer for a coffee break or when <u>skipping work</u>!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/a8c29fd26d014d5912d01fb87c262d5a.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anti-social, single played multiplayer experience! Challenge other players directly in <strong><i>THE RETRIBUTION</i></strong> mode and beat their <i>Hellrun </i>scores asynchronously. Online leaderboards and punishing daily challenges included as well!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/a1a3283bd7e85f4134b677231b7d495d.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath, seed based procedurally generated gameplay, dynamic weather, incredible realistic violence modeling and 2.5D physics combined with huge variety of weapons, enemies, power-ups, maps, secrets and bosses will give bang for your buck while keeping you busy! </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/30a361555ebe2c9df7a37fdccc6b4499.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in the good ol' days! Think Doom, Alien Breed, Hotline Miami and Tetris had a baby on steroids. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/cb1a808337704b37687a54135679412e.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We guarantee: The combination of acid house, techno and game tunes from the 80's and the 90's will make the killing as easy as breathing.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/d6908a0fe1097f7a2b7dec4e034d165d.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the times when video games whooped everyone's asses? Those days are back: Stand your ground and fight! </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/84f16eeab602cf7eca6c4cb96ec2ea16.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy the ticket, take the ride. Horde will be fully released in 2026.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/c0c6c1bf0bd9c3a3e3ea140f8de10a06.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=258 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Civilization has fallen.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Horde, launch yourself to the Zone and die purging the Hellspawn invasion in the humanity's last stand while competing for the highest scored <strong>Hellruns</strong> on the official leaderboards with other players!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/be334a415d396a8657eb290eea3705f0.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes signature <i>Ultraviolent gameplay</i> combined with 2.5D physics will put a smile even on the most conservative face. Shoot, slice, burn, electrocute, blow-up and pulverize hundreds of enemies at the same time. Combining kills also adds score multiplier (and makes you look like a pro). </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/bf6f2db9da6a050612d5e7251ca03917.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each <i>Hellrun</i> is divided to different Zones, that need to be purged from the Hellspawn to advance into the next one. Typical <i>Hellrun</i> only takes a few minutes. Perfect time killer for a coffee break or when <u>skipping work</u>!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/a8c29fd26d014d5912d01fb87c262d5a.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anti-social, single played multiplayer experience! Challenge other players directly in <strong><i>THE RETRIBUTION</i></strong> mode and beat their <i>Hellrun </i>scores asynchronously. Online leaderboards and punishing daily challenges included as well!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/a1a3283bd7e85f4134b677231b7d495d.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath, seed based procedurally generated gameplay, dynamic weather, incredible realistic violence modeling and 2.5D physics combined with huge variety of weapons, enemies, power-ups, maps, secrets and bosses will give bang for your buck while keeping you busy! </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/30a361555ebe2c9df7a37fdccc6b4499.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like in the good ol' days! Think Doom, Alien Breed, Hotline Miami and Tetris had a baby on steroids. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/cb1a808337704b37687a54135679412e.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We guarantee: The combination of acid house, techno and game tunes from the 80's and the 90's will make the killing as easy as breathing.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/d6908a0fe1097f7a2b7dec4e034d165d.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember the times when video games whooped everyone's asses? Those days are back: Stand your ground and fight! </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/extras/84f16eeab602cf7eca6c4cb96ec2ea16.avif?t=1785729769\" width=800 height=100 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy the ticket, take the ride. Horde will be fully released in 2026.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Ultraviolent blast from the past and merciless punishment to the wussy new gen. Make enemies online by challenging their Hellruns on global leaderboards while annihilating endless swarms of Hellspawn in this procedurally generated massacre. Coming 2026.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/3ddd9c2a9b35a72e7a0e0b5b8d7177ea85107c6e/header.jpg?t=1785729769", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/0f4cfaa55153e58f922b3e0abce89dc7441590c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785729769", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2145880/0f4cfaa55153e58f922b3e0abce89dc7441590c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785729769", "website": "https://horde-game.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD FX-4300 (4 * 3800) or equivalent / Intel Core i3-3240 (2 * 3400) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon HD 7750 (1024 VRAM) or equivalent / GeForce GT 640 (2048 VRAM) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS High Sierra and above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD FX-4300 (4 * 3800) or equivalent / Intel Core i3-3240 (2 * 3400) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon HD 7750 (1024 VRAM) or equivalent / GeForce GT 640 (2048 VRAM) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor &amp; operating system and skill to kill effectively while not dying</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:<